{"id":3203,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2024年12月18日上午，学院2025年国家自然科学基金专家指导会在527会议室召开。本次会议特邀了江南大学丁锋教授和常州大学徐玲教授专程指导，旨在为学院教师提供国家自然科学基金申报的专业指导与建议。学院2025年拟申报国基金的老师参与了本次会议。</p><p>丁教授围绕申报中的立项依据、研究内容、研究方案、拟解决的关键科学问题、创新点和研究基础等关键点进行了详细介绍；徐教授围绕提高科技论文写作水平进行了指导。</p><p></p><p><br /></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MzWKfL8-8nzA2MORCZUzQkL4GiUmTxkUNl8M4L4MRvZM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRMShRM1y4M4N8M7-8M4AfUzVfnNnknzWfoRTfn7-iU4QFnlC8U4MVnNQFLzffM8CJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLmU0oR9Zokbw62J8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FC5C637944B478AA1AFDBE2A89ADB5C6/EF4C3EFF/10A7F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MlnKkMmnVU47sMOzCsUz62UmM7U4WxVo7linRNbUN-soRN0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hfMSy8LSh7LmlYLNVknz62MRTkU8lZMR-4LN-ZL7WkU8QFn7UaLlQ2MRMFMNVVnRGagtXaQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLR-8g49ZoR9JqdJnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/L8UKaMml4UmT2MORf2LmlPLRNaMm7xsU8-8L778LNWRn7C0gihFp2hmCIa0M1y8LYyDMkhkLzVVUmN8U4AkUNlinmLYM4C8nznfUlQRLlWFLmrVMmN8Mz6FnzGYMkb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0LzGYMkyZoR9ZgtA8pUJcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/64364B11EB94C8BBE5F32764E4AAFC1B/25E69457/E024\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/Mm-KDM4LDnNLbLOmARUNCZnR-aU4Ux4LR-ZL7lZUN7PUmN0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh2LYh7MSyDLl7sM4MRMzG4nNLZM8r7ozNiL46koRvsL4rFo7M2ozN8nmMFLm9YUzLJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLmU0oR9Zokbw62J8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br /><br /></p><p>12月18日下午，两位专家在认真听取老师们的汇报或审阅申报书文本后，逐一进行了点评与指导。他们不仅肯定了教师们的科研成果与研究方案，还针对申报书文本中存在的问题与不足提出了宝贵的修改建议。专家们严谨的态度、专业的点评，让与会教师受益匪浅。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MmLKsUNCbLl-YMO7LYU4nVo7LsLNlx4n7UbMzG8LmGPMmL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1h7L1hVnSh7U4CZoz7YUl7inzMVMNUbUlrVMzv8nzNPUzrFMzMkM4-ao7nFLzUDnRLJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLmU0oR9Zokbw62J8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6D2EEDC68912AA5E3E6D9AEE574E91A5/53B7208D/146D3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U87KPnR7sMR62MONLYLmUsL4W7L4Uxsn7LDo7-8L4lbL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVnkhkMYh2M4W2nm9DUzvaLlUZL8L8LmWRU8-YUzrRozWFoRMfUNWkoRQFM8UiUmA7gtXaQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLR-8g49ZoR9JqdJnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/M4CKsLz7YolU4LONMfnlLZMz-anmWxkL8UPolLZMllDLRv0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4oSyPMYhVUm-4M7WVMmvPLRN4MmLYL4lZoRGsLmlbUzQFoRl4U4AVLmrFLz9ZnR9Jqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLmU0oR9Zokbw62J8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/43917EB234BE671093632358807259A6/853C8E25/188D8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LlnKRU8lbnzVkUOz7snmNZMl7sMNlxYM7WVnlCPU8lZMz90gihFp2hmCIa0okysnkhVU1yYLmAVL7UZnNVkLmLbM8MRLzVkLmQRUm94LmfFU8CaLz9ZnmTFM4CDLRffgtXaQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLR-8g49ZoR9JqdJnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/Mm9KaM87aU4MVoORLiUzLiL7LZolQx2ozTRU8-PM7-ZnmC0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkLky4MkhVo77aM8C4n7C8L478nzGZMz7bnRlPUzCsLlQFL4-8M4LsL4AFLz6RoRvJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLmU0oR9Zokbw62J8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4B034E8A07F3DF4314E08519D51A671F/32473738/17C87\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nNnK2nzUZMzlsnOm-8UznVLN-sozTx7nNrfMN-sMRv4L8l0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDL1hkU1hfMmrRMmLaUzGPLzTfMzMVMzMkMNU8MNLbU8QFM7lsnN-8olWFoRNsoR9agtXaQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLR-8g49ZoR9JqdJnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br /><br /></p><p>通过此次指导会，不仅加深了学院教师对国家自然科学基金申报书撰写的认识和理解，还有助于进一步凝练关键科学问题和优化研究方案。</p><p>此次国家自然科学基金指导会的成功举办，不仅为学院教师提供了宝贵的交流与学习机会，也为推动学院科研工作的发展注入了新的活力。</p><p><br /></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MzWKfL8-8nzA2MORCZUzQkL4GiUmTxkUNl8M4L4MRvZM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRMShRM1y4M4N8M7-8M4AfUzVfnNnknzWfoRTfn7-iU4QFnlC8U4MVnNQFLzffM8CJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLmU0oR9Zokbw62J8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1024&nid=8888&e=.jpg"}